// new unlocked callers in the three original shapes; the executable
// controls TestWritePathGateFlagsExecutableRogues prove it sees the four
// CR6 reviewer evasion shapes plus two producer shapes, each paired with
// proof that the flagged construct really mutates. The hold-require-skip
// and replace-require-skip mutation plants prove the runtime capability
// behaviorally.

